<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia 364-day T-bill average 6.344 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia 364-day T-bill average 6.344 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Negara Malaysia said on Friday it accepted bids at an average yield of 6.344 percent at its auction of 364-day Treasury bills for 100 million ringgit.</p>
<p>At its previous auction of 364-day Treasury bills on April 24 for a similar amount, the average yield was 6.41 percent.</p>
<p>The bids accepted were in a high/low range of 6.352/329 percent against 6.429/375 previously, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Bank Negara said it would hold the next auction of 91-day Treasury bills for 80 million ringgit and 182-day bills for 100 million ringgit on May 15.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-206 2323)</p>
</text>
